WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.888
Yʋʋm wʋsg sẽn looge, sẽn deng t'a Zeova nin-buiidã kẽed tẽn-kãnga, zĩ-yũudd a ye n kẽng Waagadougou rɩtgẽ wã.

00:00:09.968 --> 00:00:14.095
A ra baood-a lame daar fãa, t'a yaool n bas-a.

00:00:14.175 --> 00:00:16.381
Zĩ-kãnga ra yõogda tẽngã.

00:00:16.461 --> 00:00:23.331
A sẽn da gãneg a gãagã ra pa tarẽ ye, la a nao wã ra pa le tõe n gãneg-a ye.

00:00:23.411 --> 00:00:31.013
B yeelame t'a gãe tɩɩgã tẽngre, a sẽn da tẽed tɩ a pa na n leb n yã a tẽn-gãongã ye.

00:00:31.093 --> 00:00:34.305
Rẽ n so t'a bõn-buudã yii we-kãense.

00:00:34.385 --> 00:00:39.884
Kẽerã sẽn da pa tar pãng n na n zoe wã kɩtame t'a sul a ninã.

00:00:39.964 --> 00:00:41.713
La rũngã pa kʋ-a ye.

00:00:41.793 --> 00:00:48.297
A Zezi kẽnga taoor bilfu, n yals n wẽnemd b poorẽ n yeel-a t'a tũ bãmba.

00:00:48.377 --> 00:00:55.796
Kẽerã yikame n tũ-a n ta ko-kãseng sẽn be koom-koɛɛgẽ, tɩ b solg-a-la tɩɩsã poorẽ.

00:00:55.876 --> 00:01:01.192
A rɩka bõn-yũudlã, n paam sũ-noogo, la a lebg n tara pãnga.

00:01:01.272 --> 00:01:07.593
La raoã leb n waa a zak rãmb nengẽ n togs-b bũmb nins fãa a sẽn maanã.

00:01:07.673 --> 00:01:15.001
B yeelame tɩ daarã, b maana kaool n yeel tɩ Sebõ nebã ra na n maan bõn-naands ye.

00:01:15.081 --> 00:01:21.128
Hal tɩ ta rũndã-rũndã, b ket n getame t'a Zeova waoogda a bu-zẽmsã.

00:01:21.208 --> 00:01:29.724
Tẽngã neb pa yɛɛsd-b ye, la b yetame tɩ b sã n wa ki, b waoogd-a-la wa b sẽn waoogd ned to-to.

00:01:29.804 --> 00:01:37.041
Neb n wat n na n ges-b-la neere, tɩ tẽn-kãng neb n wilgd-b b sẽn maand to-to wã.

00:01:37.121 --> 00:01:43.351
Kãsem-dãmbã sã n togsd kom-bɩɩsã yel-bũndã, b baasda ne manesem a ye.

00:01:43.431 --> 00:01:46.826
B pa yĩmda bark ning b sẽn maan-bã ye.
